        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR1835, Dual Level 18\" Wire Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNever have storage issues again--at least not in the bathroom. The WBR1835 Rectangular Wire Basket is perfect for storing all your bathroom toiletries from shampoo bottles to soap. But this shelf is also useful in all parts of the house including the kitchen, the garage, and the kid's rooms. Made by Deltana out of solid brass, it is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and pvd polished brass finishes. Featuring a two level design it easy mounts to the wall.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1835-specifications.jpg?v=1704354574\" width=\"530\" height=\"330\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR1835 18\" Rectangular Combination Level Wire Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR1835 Solid Brass Two Level Rectangular Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth (highest level): 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth (lowest level): 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lower Level Length: 5\"</l>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1835.pdf?v=1704262294\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR1835 18\" Rectangular Combination Level Wire Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
