                "title": "Two Level Rectangular 18 Inch Wire Basket, Deltana WBR1835",
                "description": "Deltana WBR1835 Two Level Rectangular 18 Inch Wire Basket - Never have storage issues again--at least not in the bathroom. The WBR1835 Rectangular Wire Basket is perfect for storing all your bathroom toiletries from shampoo bottles to soap. But this shelf is also useful in all parts of the house including the kitchen, the garage, and the kid's rooms. Made by Deltana out of solid brass, it is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and pvd polished brass finishes. Featuring a two level design it easy mounts to the wall.",
